---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Why Porphyra exists, and what 'judgement, not volume' actually means in practice."
>
  <main class="page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>About Porphyra</h1>
    </header>

    <section>
      <p>
        Job search advice has converged on volume: apply everywhere, let the numbers work
        for you. It doesn't, really — a posting with three hundred applicants doesn't get
        fairer because you're applicant three hundred and one. What actually moves the
        needle is targeting: knowing which roles are worth real effort before you spend the
        evening on a tailored CV and a cover letter nobody will read past the first
        paragraph.
      </p>
      <p>
        Porphyra is built around that idea. Score honestly, recommend against weak matches
        instead of staying quiet about them, and treat your CV and search data as something
        we're custodians of, not a resource to mine.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Where the name comes from</h2>
      <p>
        Πορφύρα — Greek for both the murex sea snail and the Tyrian purple dye extracted
        from it. It took roughly twelve thousand snails to produce a gram and a half of dye,
        which is why it was reserved for what had actually been earned rather than produced
        at scale. That's the whole thesis, in one word.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>What we're not</h2>
      <p>
        We're not a browser extension that auto-fills forms without reading them, and we
        never submit an application on your behalf — you always press the final button. See
        <a href="/how-it-works">how it works</a> and <a href="/security">how the encryption
        works</a> for the specifics.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="cta">
      <a href="/#waitlist">Get early access &rarr;</a>
    </section>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .page { max-width: 42rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--p-space-16) var(--p-space-6); }
  .page-header { margin-bottom: var(--p-space-8); }
  .page-header h1 { font-family: var(--p-font-display); font-size: var(--p-text-5xl); color: var(--p-porphyra-900); margin: 0; }
  section { margin-bottom: var(--p-space-10); }
  h2 { font-family: var(--p-font-display); font-size: var(--p-text-2xl); color: var(--p-porphyra-900); margin-bottom: var(--p-space-3); }
  p { color: var(--color-muted); font-size: var(--p-text-lg); }
  .cta { text-align: center; }
  .cta a {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--button-primary-bg);
    color: var(--button-primary-fg);
    padding: var(--button-padding-y) var(--button-padding-x);
    border-radius: var(--button-radius);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
